    <section class="empire-glance" id="at-a-glance" aria-labelledby="glance-title">
      <div class="empire-glance-main"><h2 class="empire-glance-title" id="glance-title">At a glance</h2><ul><li>The Third Republic was proclaimed on 4 September 1870, after <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/napoleon-iii">Napoleon III</a>'s capture at the Battle of Sedan, and lasted until 10 July 1940.</li><li>Intended as a provisional government while monarchists disagreed over a king, it became <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>'s permanent form of government under the constitutional laws of 1875.</li><li>It built a colonial empire second in size only to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/british-empire">British Empire</a>, extending over 13,500,000 km2 at its height in the 1920s and 1930s.</li></ul></div>
      <aside class="empire-dyk"><p class="empire-dyk-title">Did you know?</p><p>To discourage the monarchists, the French Crown Jewels were broken up and sold in 1885; only a few crowns were kept, their precious gems replaced by coloured glass.</p></aside>
    </section>

